WEBVTT

00:08:59.094 --> 00:09:00.644
I love that phrase.

00:09:00.644 --> 00:09:05.724
It's about designing, not appearance, but experience,

00:09:05.724 --> 00:09:09.332
so that we have spaces that sound as good as they look,

00:09:09.332 --> 00:09:12.842
that are fit for purpose, that improve our quality of life,

00:09:12.842 --> 00:09:16.083
our health and well being, our social behavior

00:09:16.083 --> 00:09:17.959
and our productivity.

00:09:17.959 --> 00:09:21.465
It's time to start designing for the ears.

00:09:21.465 --> 00:09:24.295
Thank you. (Applause)

00:09:24.295 --> 00:09:25.827
(Applause)

00:09:25.827 --> 00:09:30.583
Thank you. (Applause)